# Time Tracking System Process Flow

        ## User Data Structure
        ```json
        {
        "userId": 1234,
        "name": "John Doe",
        "sessionStatus": "Online",
        "lastActivity": "2024-09-09 15:01:01",
        "dayStartTime": "2024-09-09 09:00:00",
        "currentStartTime": "2024-09-09 14:00:00",
        "lastPauseTime": null,
        "totalWorkedMinutes": 360,
        "lunchBreakDeducted": false,
        "temporaryStops": [
        {"startTime": "2024-09-09 10:00:00", "endTime": "2024-09-09 11:00:00", "duration": 60},
        {"startTime": "2024-09-09 13:00:00", "endTime": "2024-09-09 14:00:00", "duration": 60}
        ],
        "totalTemporaryStopMinutes": 120,
        "temporaryStopCount": 2,
        "workdayCompleted": false
        }
        ```

        ## Process Flow

        1. Start Day
        - User presses "Start" button
        - Set `dayStartTime` and `currentStartTime`
        - Initialize `totalWorkedMinutes` to 0
        - Set `lunchBreakDeducted` to false
        - Set `workdayCompleted` to false

        2. During Work
        - Continuously update `totalWorkedMinutes`

        3. Temporary Stop
        - User presses "Temporary Stop" button
        - Record start time of stop
        - Change `sessionStatus` to "Temporary Stop"

        4. Resume from Temporary Stop
        - User presses "Resume" button
        - Record end time of stop
        - Calculate duration and add to `totalTemporaryStopMinutes`
        - Add new entry to `temporaryStops` array
        - Increment `temporaryStopCount`

        5. Ongoing Time Check
        - Continuously check `totalWorkedMinutes`:
        - If `totalWorkedMinutes` reaches 510 (8 hours 30 minutes) and `lunchBreakDeducted` is false:
        - Subtract 30 minutes from `totalWorkedMinutes`
        - Set `lunchBreakDeducted` to true
        - Set `workdayCompleted` to true
        - Display message "Work day finished"
        - If `totalWorkedMinutes` reaches 720 (12 hours):
        - If `lunchBreakDeducted` is false, set it to true but don't subtract time
        - Set `workdayCompleted` to true (if not already)
        - Display message "Maximum work day reached"

        6. End Day
        - User presses "End" button
        - System performs final time check:
        - If 480 ≤ `totalWorkedMinutes` < 510 and `lunchBreakDeducted` is false:
        - Subtract 30 minutes from `totalWorkedMinutes`
        - Set `lunchBreakDeducted` to true
        - If `totalWorkedMinutes` ≥ 480:
        - Set `workdayCompleted` to true
        - Display message "Work day finished"
        - If `totalWorkedMinutes` < 480:
        - Display message "Minimum work time not met"
        - Change `sessionStatus` to "Offline"

        7. Overtime Calculation
        - If `totalWorkedMinutes` > 480:
        - Overtime = `totalWorkedMinutes` - 480
        - Store overtime in a separate structure-->
